  unitName: Moon Sovereign Alicia
  unitId: 50463
  unitNumber: 1292
  description: A high-ranked priestess of the Elgaia Federation at the time of the
    establishment of Akras Summoners' Hall. Most religious faiths in Elgaia generally
    regarded Lucius as their deity, and Alicia was an unquestioning believer. When
    Lucius' Gate opened, she saw the Summoner crossing it as "the one chosen by our
    god," and strove to promote belief in the Summoners' Hall as a sacred temple.
    However, the Federation elite saw this as a challenge to their authority, and
    Alicia was arrested for treason.
  summonDesc: Summoner, you are the chosen one. It is an honor to serve you. Please,
    ask of me anything you desire.
  fusionDesc: This feeling of fulfillment...is the work of our divine Summoner, and
    the true will of our god.
